   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_VICH_01">
                                    <choice>
                                        <sic>​​hotel beaujolais</sic>
                                        <corr>Hotel Beaujolais</corr>
                                    </choice>
                                </name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_VICH">Vichy</name> Allier,</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA">France</name>
                            </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Merci. Vous répondez toujours vite et à propos. Nous passons quelques semaines ici assez agréablement.</p> <closer>
                        <salute>Salutations à toute la famille</salute>
                        <salute>bien à vous</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>Hotel Beaujolais</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>Vichy Allier,</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>France</addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                    <p>Thanks. You always answer quickly and to the point. We are spending a few weeks here quite pleasantly.</p> <closer>
                        <salute>Greetings to the whole family</salute>
                        <salute>sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>James Joyce</signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="global-note1" type="global">This postcard shows a tinted photograph captioned “364 – Vichy. – Source de la Grande Grille, température 41⁰ débit 3000 litres à l’heure”. The image depicts the Grande Grille, one of the celebrated Vichy springs, the water of which flowed naturally at a temperature of 41 degrees Celsius (106 degrees Fahrenheit) and with an output of 3,000 liters per hour, according to the caption. The postcard was produced by “Édition la Cicogne”, Place de l’Hôtel de Ville, Vichy.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
